/E (Regardless of what information we are getting in a reading, whether it be through time, space, or even other dimensions, it is experienced in consciousness in the present moment. In the same way as every card is a name, form, function, or phase of the fool, so every divination is either a name, form, or function of pure awareness. Being in awareness allows us to experience and know more about what is happening. Being in awareness is simply a choice.)
